{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Form is written 100% in "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TypeScript"}]},{"type":"text","value":" with the highest quality generics, constraints, and interfaces to make sure the library and your projects are as type-safe as possible!"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Things to keep in mind:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"strict: true"},{"type":"text","value":" is required in your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tsconfig.json"},{"type":"text","value":" to get the most out of TanStack Form's types"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Types currently require using TypeScript v5.4 or greater"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Changes to types in this repository are considered "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"non-breaking"}]},{"type":"text","value":" and are usually released as "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"patch"}]},{"type":"text","value":" semver changes (otherwise every type enhancement would be a major version!)."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"It is "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"highly recommended that you lock your react-form package version to a specific patch release and upgrade with the expectation that types may be fixed or upgraded between any release"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The non-type-related public API of TanStack Form still follows semver very strictly."}]}]}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nTanStack Form is written 100% in **TypeScript** with the highest quality generics, constraints, and interfaces to make sure the library and your projects are as type-safe as possible!\n\nThings to keep in mind:\n\n- `strict: true` is required in your `tsconfig.json` to get the most out of TanStack Form's types\n- Types currently require using TypeScript v5.4 or greater\n- Changes to types in this repository are considered **non-breaking** and are usually released as **patch** semver changes (otherwise every type enhancement would be a major version!).\n- It is **highly recommended that you lock your react-form package version to a specific patch release and upgrade with the expectation that types may be fixed or upgraded between any release**\n- The non-type-related public API of TanStack Form still follows semver very strictly.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: typescript\ntitle: TypeScript\n---\n\nTanStack Form is written 100% in **TypeScript** with the highest quality generics, constraints, and interfaces to make sure the library and your projects are as type-safe as possible!\n\nThings to keep in mind:\n\n- `strict: true` is required in your `tsconfig.json` to get the most out of TanStack Form's types\n- Types currently require using TypeScript v5.4 or greater\n- Changes to types in this repository are considered **non-breaking** and are usually released as **patch** semver changes (otherwise every type enhancement would be a major version!).\n- It is **highly recommended that you lock your react-form package version to a specific patch release and upgrade with the expectation that types may be fixed or upgraded between any release**\n- The non-type-related public API of TanStack Form still follows semver very strictly.\n"}
